{"id":"eaa15562bbd8fa45","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/159_Cook_等式理论_PV.md","title":"159 Cook 等式理论 PV","display":"159_Cook_等式理论_PV","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>PV 的函数符号按 arity 分层。初始函数符号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0:0,\\quad S:1,\\quad s_0:1,\\quad s_1:1,\\quad p:1,\\quad |-|:1,\\quad \\# :2,\\quad \\operatorname{leq}:2,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0:0,\\quad S:1,\\quad s_0:1,\\quad s_1:1,\\quad p:1,\\quad |-|:1,\\quad \\# :2,\\quad \\operatorname{leq}:2,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 的投影</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi^n_i:n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi^n_i:n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是一元后继，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\">\\(s_0\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_1\">\\(s_1\\)</span> 是二进制后继构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是二进制前驱，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|x|\">\\(|x|\\)</span> 是二进制长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\#y\">\\(x\\#y\\)</span> 是长度受控增长函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{leq}(x,y)\">\\(\\operatorname{leq}(x,y)\\)</span> 是取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(0)\">\\(S(0)\\)</span> 的比较函数。PV 的目标差异是等式理论：公式只有同项等式，没有量词和逻辑联结词。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-PV-函数符号类\">2. PV 函数符号类</h1>\n<p>PV 函数符号集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span> 与 arity 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小对象：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>初始符号属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>，arity 如第 1 节所列；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:m\">\\(g:m\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}:n\">\\(h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}:n\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>，则组合符号\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}):n\">\\(C(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}):n\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:n\">\\(g:n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:n+2\">\\(h:n+2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:n+1\">\\(b:n+1\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>，则有界二进制递归符号\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(g,h,b):n+1\">\\(R(g,h,b):n+1\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(g,h,b)\">\\(R(g,h,b)\\)</span> 的形成只增加一个函数符号；其允许使用的等式由第 4 节公理列出。</p>\n<p>组合和有界递归的 arity 侧条件记为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PVCompOK}(g,\\vec h,n,m)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}(g)=m\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\,\\operatorname{ar}(h_i)=n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PVCompOK}(g,\\vec h,n,m)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}(g)=m\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\,\\operatorname{ar}(h_i)=n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PVRecOK}(g,h,b,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}(g)=n\\land \\operatorname{ar}(h)=n+2\\land\n\\operatorname{ar}(b)=n+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PVRecOK}(g,h,b,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}(g)=n\\land \\operatorname{ar}(h)=n+2\\land\n\\operatorname{ar}(b)=n+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-项、自由变量与替换\">3. 项、自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(f\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>等式公式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}=\\{s\\doteq t:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}=\\{s\\doteq t:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(x)=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}))=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(x)=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}))=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x[y:=u]=\n\\begin{cases}\nu,&amp;x=y,\\\\\nx,&amp;x\\ne y,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x[y:=u]=\n\\begin{cases}\nu,&amp;x=y,\\\\\nx,&amp;x\\ne y,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})[y:=u]=\nf(t_0[y:=u],\\ldots,t_{n-1}[y:=u]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})[y:=u]=\nf(t_0[y:=u],\\ldots,t_{n-1}[y:=u]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等式替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s\\doteq t)[y:=u]=(s[y:=u]\\doteq t[y:=u]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s\\doteq t)[y:=u]=(s[y:=u]\\doteq t[y:=u]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{\\mathsf{PV}}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{\\mathsf{PV}}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{\\mathsf{PV}}:\n\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{\\mathsf{PV}}:\n\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为本节全部变量项、函数项和等式公式子句唯一确定的替换函数。记号\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r[y:=u]\">\\(r[y:=u]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[y:=u]\">\\(E[y:=u]\\)</span> 分别表示这两个函数的值。</p>\n<p>PV 没有绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV_T}(t)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(E)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV_T}(t)=\\operatorname{BV_F}(E)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}(e,x,y):=e[x:=y],\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{BoundRen}_{\\mathsf{PV}}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}(e,x,y):=e[x:=y],\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{BoundRen}_{\\mathsf{PV}}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha\\)</span> 是字面相等关系。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-定义等式公理\">4. 定义等式公理</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n=S^n(0)\">\\(\\bar n=S^n(0)\\)</span>，并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(0)=0,\\qquad \\ell(n)=\\lfloor\\log_2n\\rfloor+1\\quad(n&gt;0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(0)=0,\\qquad \\ell(n)=\\lfloor\\log_2n\\rfloor+1\\quad(n&gt;0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>初始函数公理由下列数值表唯一确定；表中每一行都是对\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的公理方案：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Init}}=\n\\{S(\\bar n)\\doteq\\overline{n+1},\\\ns_0(\\bar n)\\doteq\\overline{2n},\\\ns_1(\\bar n)\\doteq\\overline{2n+1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Init}}=\n\\{S(\\bar n)\\doteq\\overline{n+1},\\\ns_0(\\bar n)\\doteq\\overline{2n},\\\ns_1(\\bar n)\\doteq\\overline{2n+1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p(\\bar n)\\doteq\\overline{\\lfloor n/2\\rfloor},\\\n|\\bar n|\\doteq\\overline{\\ell(n)},\\\n\\bar m\\#\\bar n\\doteq\\overline{2^{\\ell(m)\\ell(n)}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p(\\bar n)\\doteq\\overline{\\lfloor n/2\\rfloor},\\\n|\\bar n|\\doteq\\overline{\\ell(n)},\\\n\\bar m\\#\\bar n\\doteq\\overline{2^{\\ell(m)\\ell(n)}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{leq}(\\bar m,\\bar n)\\doteq\n\\begin{cases}S(0),&amp;m\\le n,\\\\0,&amp;m&gt;n,\n\\end{cases}:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{leq}(\\bar m,\\bar n)\\doteq\n\\begin{cases}S(0),&amp;m\\le n,\\\\0,&amp;m&gt;n,\n\\end{cases}:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0(0)=0\">\\(s_0(0)=0\\)</span>，非零数的规范二进制分解恰为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0(S(y))\">\\(s_0(S(y))\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_1(y)\">\\(s_1(y)\\)</span>。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\">\\(\\#\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{leq}\">\\(\\operatorname{leq}\\)</span> 不再是只声明 arity 的未解释符号。初始符号的数值表、\n投影条款以及函数符号生成树共同给出每个闭 PV 项的确定性自底向上求值。</p>\n<p>投影公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Proj}}=\n\\{\\pi^n_i(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\doteq x_i:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i&lt;n,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Proj}}=\n\\{\\pi^n_i(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\doteq x_i:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i&lt;n,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组合公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Comp}}=\n\\{C(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1})(\\vec x)\\doteq\ng(h_0(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_{m-1}(\\vec x)):\nn,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var},\\\ng\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\ \\vec h:m\\to\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\n\\operatorname{PVCompOK}(g,(h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}),n,m)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Comp}}=\n\\{C(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1})(\\vec x)\\doteq\ng(h_0(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_{m-1}(\\vec x)):\nn,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var},\\\ng\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\ \\vec h:m\\to\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\n\\operatorname{PVCompOK}(g,(h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}),n,m)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有界二进制递归公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Rec0}}=\n\\{R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,0)\\doteq g(\\vec x):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var},\\\ng,h,b\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\n\\operatorname{PVRecOK}(g,h,b,n)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Rec0}}=\n\\{R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,0)\\doteq g(\\vec x):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var},\\\ng,h,b\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\n\\operatorname{PVRecOK}(g,h,b,n)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{RecS}}=\n\\{R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,s_0(S(y)))\\doteq\nh(\\vec x,S(y),R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,S(y))),\\\nR(g,h,b)(\\vec x,s_1(y))\\doteq\nh(\\vec x,y,R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,y)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var},\\ y\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\\ng,h,b\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\n\\operatorname{PVRecOK}(g,h,b,n)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{RecS}}=\n\\{R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,s_0(S(y)))\\doteq\nh(\\vec x,S(y),R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,S(y))),\\\nR(g,h,b)(\\vec x,s_1(y))\\doteq\nh(\\vec x,y,R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,y)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var},\\ y\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\\ng,h,b\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\n\\operatorname{PVRecOK}(g,h,b,n)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bound}}=\n\\{\\operatorname{leq}(R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,y),b(\\vec x,y))\\doteq S(0):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var},\\ y\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\\ng,h,b\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\n\\operatorname{PVRecOK}(g,h,b,n)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bound}}=\n\\{\\operatorname{leq}(R(g,h,b)(\\vec x,y),b(\\vec x,y))\\doteq S(0):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x:n\\to\\mathsf{Var},\\ y\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\\ng,h,b\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\n\\operatorname{PVRecOK}(g,h,b,n)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中最后一族使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{leq}\">\\(\\operatorname{leq}\\)</span> 的等式值表达边界条件。总公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{PV}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Init}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Proj}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Comp}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Rec0}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{RecS}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bound}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{PV}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Init}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Proj}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Comp}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Rec0}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{RecS}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Bound}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-等式推理规则\">5. 等式推理规则</h1>\n<p>规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{}{t\\doteq t},\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\doteq t}{t\\doteq s},\\qquad\n\\frac{r\\doteq s\\qquad s\\doteq t}{r\\doteq t},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{}{t\\doteq t},\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\doteq t}{t\\doteq s},\\qquad\n\\frac{r\\doteq s\\qquad s\\doteq t}{r\\doteq t},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{t_0\\doteq u_0\\quad\\cdots\\quad t_{n-1}\\doteq u_{n-1}}\n{f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\doteq f(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\doteq t}{(s\\doteq t)[x:=u]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{t_0\\doteq u_0\\quad\\cdots\\quad t_{n-1}\\doteq u_{n-1}}\n{f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\doteq f(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\doteq t}{(s\\doteq t)[x:=u]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相应规则关系定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{refl}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cong}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sub}}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}})^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\times\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{refl}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cong}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sub}}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}})^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\times\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{refl}}=\\{((),t\\doteq t):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{refl}}=\\{((),t\\doteq t):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}=\\{((s\\doteq t),t\\doteq s):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}=\\{((s\\doteq t),t\\doteq s):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}=\n\\{((r\\doteq s,s\\doteq t),r\\doteq t):r,s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}=\n\\{((r\\doteq s,s\\doteq t),r\\doteq t):r,s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cong}}=\n\\{((t_0\\doteq u_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}\\doteq u_{n-1}),\nf(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\doteq f(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ f\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\ \\operatorname{ar}(f)=n,\n\\ (t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\in(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}})^n,\n\\ (u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\\in(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}})^n\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cong}}=\n\\{((t_0\\doteq u_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}\\doteq u_{n-1}),\nf(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\doteq f(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ f\\in\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\ \\operatorname{ar}(f)=n,\n\\ (t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\in(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}})^n,\n\\ (u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\\in(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}})^n\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sub}}=\n\\{((s\\doteq t),(s\\doteq t)[x:=u]):\ns,t,u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sub}}=\n\\{((s\\doteq t),(s\\doteq t)[x:=u]):\ns,t,u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-有限推导\">6. 有限推导</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathsf{PV}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathsf{PV}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限等式序列、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{m-1}=E\">\\(E_{m-1}=E\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_j\">\\(E_j\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_j\\in\\Gamma\">\\(E_j\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(E_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(() ,E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\">\\((() ,E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j\">\\(r&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_r),E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}\">\\(((E_r),E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s&lt;j\">\\(r,s&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_r,E_s),E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}\">\\(((E_r,E_s),E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与索引函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:n\\to j\">\\(\\rho:n\\to j\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_{\\rho(0)},\\ldots,E_{\\rho(n-1)}),E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cong}}\">\\(((E_{\\rho(0)},\\ldots,E_{\\rho(n-1)}),E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cong}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j\">\\(r&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_r),E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sub}}\">\\(((E_r),E_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sub}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证等式\">7. 可证等式</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{PV}}E\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathsf{PV}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{PV}}E\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathsf{PV}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{PV}}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\operatorname{ar},\n\\operatorname{PVCompOK},\\operatorname{PVRecOK},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\n\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BV_T},\\operatorname{BV_F},\n\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{\\mathsf{PV}},\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{\\mathsf{PV}},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen},\\mathsf{BoundRen}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\equiv_\\alpha,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{refl}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cong}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sub}},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{PV}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{PV}}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\operatorname{ar},\n\\operatorname{PVCompOK},\\operatorname{PVRecOK},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\mathsf{EqFrm}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\n\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BV_T},\\operatorname{BV_F},\n\\operatorname{Sub_T}^{\\mathsf{PV}},\\operatorname{Sub_F}^{\\mathsf{PV}},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen},\\mathsf{BoundRen}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\equiv_\\alpha,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{refl}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cong}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sub}},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathsf{PV}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{PV}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只给出 Cook PV 的等式理论；不包含一阶量词、公式归纳、公理化证明谓词、PV<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_1\">\\(_1\\)</span> 的开公式归纳方案、语义载体、解释、赋值、满足关系、真值、有效性或语义后承。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-PV-函数符号类","text":"2. PV 函数符号类","level":1},{"id":"3.-项、自由变量与替换","text":"3. 项、自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-定义等式公理","text":"4. 定义等式公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-等式推理规则","text":"5. 等式推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-有限推导","text":"6. 有限推导","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证等式","text":"7. 可证等式","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"0:0,\\quad S:1,\\quad s_0:1,\\quad s_1:1,\\quad p:1,\\quad |-|:1,\\quad \\# :2,\\quad \\operatorname{leq}:2,","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"i<n","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi^n_i:n.","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"s_0","display":false},{"tex":"s_1","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"|x|","display":false},{"tex":"x\\#y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{leq}(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S(0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}","display":false},{"tex":"g:m","display":false},{"tex":"h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}:n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}","display":false},{"tex":"C(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}):n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}","display":false},{"tex":"g:n","display":false},{"tex":"h:n+2","display":false},{"tex":"b:n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathsf{PV}}","display":false},{"tex":"R(g,h,b):n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fun}_{\\m